{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36668","headline":"淮南送卢端公归台 · 罗隐","name":"淮南送卢端公归台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤鸾势逸九霄宽，北去南来任羽翰。\n朱绂两参王俭府，绣衣三领杜林官。\n道从上国曾匡济，才向牢盆始重难。\n应笑张纲谩生事，埋轮不得在长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}